@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 65
hide footbox
title BorrowRecord 借阅记录状态图
state "待借出\nPENDING_LEND" as PENDING_LEND
state "借出中\nON_LOAN" as ON_LOAN
state "已完成\nCOMPLETED" as COMPLETED
[*] --> PENDING_LEND : 可用复本分配成功 / 创建借阅记录
PENDING_LEND --> ON_LOAN : UC02 管理员确认交付\n/ 记录 lentAt，复本转 ON_LOAN
ON_LOAN --> COMPLETED : UC05 管理员确认收回\n/ 记录 returnedAt，释放复本
note right of PENDING_LEND
来源：直接借书或预约激活
关联复本必须为 RESERVED
end note
note right of COMPLETED
业务终态，历史记录保留用于报表
无后续借出或归还转换
end note
@enduml
